# ==============================================================================
#  K-Certificate Manager - Comprehensive .gitignore
#  Prevents build artifacts, binaries, portable files, IDE caches & sensitive leaks
#  Only essential project source codes, assets, and build configs are allowed.
# ==============================================================================

# 1. Node & Web Build Artifacts
node_modules/
dist/
build/
coverage/
.vite/
bun.lock
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*

# 2. .NET / C# WPF Build & Compiled Binaries (Prevents GitHub 100MB file limit errors)
release/
deploy/
bin/
obj/
**/bin/
**/obj/
PublishProfiles/
TestResults/
*.user
*.userosscache
*.suo
*.sln.docstates
*_wpftmp*
*.pdb
*.tmp
*.cache
*.dll
*.exe
*.msi
KCert.Core.dll

# 3. Inno Setup & Installer Build Outputs
Output/
_Output/
*.iss.tmp

# 4. Portable Packages & Archives (Unpacked Multi-File 설치 대상 아님)
portable/
Portable/
*.zip
*.7z
*.rar
*.tar
*.tar.gz
*.iso
*.cab

# 5. IDEs, Editors & AI Workspace
.vs/
.idea/
.vscode/*
!.vscode/extensions.json
.aistudio/
*.swp
*.bak
*.orig
~$*

# 6. Operating System Junk
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
ehthumbs.db
desktop.ini

# 7. Environment & Security (Prevent leaking private keys, real certs, or secrets)
.env*
!.env.example
*.log
# Strictly prevent accidental committing of user's personal/real digital certificates or keys
*.pfx
*.p12
*.key
*.pri
*.der
*.cer
*.pem
*.crt
# Exception for mock assets if needed (assets folder only)
!src/data/**

# 8. Unnecessary Root Artifacts & Temporary Scripts
/scripts/
/AI_INSTRUCTIONS.md
/*.ico
K-인증서 매니저-메인.png
K-인증서 매니저-시트.png

# 9. Local Git Credentials and User Data
*.credential
*.credentials

# 10. Local GitHub Push Scripts & Tools (원격 깃허브 업로드 제외 대상 - 로컬 전용)
push_to_github.bat
push_to_github.ps1
tools/
/tools/
